OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar                
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of mostly 
OL,6,Flight and patchy rain in the morning,  
OL,7,Fwintry over the hills. Mostly cloudy   
OL,8,Fin the afternoon with rain easing and  
OL,9,Fbecoming dry for most by the evening.  
OL,10,FMostly light winds, fresh in the west. 
OL,12,CTonight:FMostly cloudy over the        
OL,13,FWestern Isles with the odd shower and  
OL,14,Fwinds becoming strong. Further east    
OL,15,Fwill be dry with clear spells          
OL,16,Fdeveloping and frost forming overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
